speechtext:
That on Friday, July 18, 1958, and on every Friday and Saturday thereafter until the end of this session, the hours of sitting shall be as follows:
Fridays
11:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m., and 2:30 p.m. to 6:00 p.m., and 8:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.;
Saturdays
11:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m., and 2:30 p.m. to 6:00 p.m.;
That the order of business and procedure on Saturdays shall be as for Thursday (government day); and that the provisions of standing orders 2(1) and 6(3) be suspended in relation thereto.
